## TEMPLATE-010 — Data-dictionary field record

| Attribute | Fillable value |
|---|---|
| File basename / field name | `[BASENAME]` / `[EXACT_FIELD]` |
| Business label / definition | `[LABEL]` / `[ONE_MEANING_AT_DECLARED_GRAIN]` |
| Logical type / required | `[TYPE]` / `[TRUE_OR_FALSE]` |
| Null meaning / companion reason | `[MEANING]` / `[FIELD_OR_NOT_APPLICABLE]` |
| Allowed values or range | `[ENUM_RANGE_OR_PATTERN]` |
| Unit, scale, currency, denominator | `[VALUES_OR_NOT_APPLICABLE]` |
| Date or period semantics | `[EFFECTIVE_AS_OF_INTERVAL_PUBLICATION_ACCESS_OR_RELEASE]` |
| Key role / reference / cardinality | `[ROLE]` / `[TARGET]` / `[CARDINALITY]` |
| Source and derivation class | `[OBSERVED_DERIVED_INFERRED_METADATA_OR_MIXED]` |
| Standardization and provenance | `[RULE]` / `[REQUIRED_LINK]` |
| Introduced / deprecated | `[VERSION]` / `[VERSION_AND_REPLACEMENT_OR_NULL]` |

